    "body": "Note that the opaque-host parser doesn't return on that line. It just signifies there's a validation error. Not all parsers report validation errors and it would be non-conforming to halt parsing there (unless I suppose the parser was specifically configured to halt on validation errors, but that's not a web-exposed entry point).",
